---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Technical Expertise"
  description="Technical skills and expertise across full-stack development: Backend (Go, Laravel), Frontend (Vue, React, Astro), DevOps (Docker, CI/CD), and best practices."
  keywords="Technical Skills, Go Programming, Laravel PHP, Vue.js Developer, React Developer, Astro Framework, Backend Development, Frontend Development, DevOps, Docker, CI/CD, Full Stack Skills"
>
  <section class="w-full py-10 space-y-8">
    <div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-semibold tracking-wider mb-4">Technical Expertise</h1>
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl xq-accent-muted leading-relaxed">
        Specialized skills across the full technology stack
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
      <div class="border xq-border rounded-lg p-6 md:p-8 xq-transition hover:shadow-lg">
        <div class="flex items-center mb-4">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-blue-500/10 flex items-center justify-center mr-4">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 xq-accent" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 12h14M5 12l4-4m-4 4l4 4"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-semibold">Backend Development</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="text-base leading-relaxed mb-4 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
          Building robust, scalable server-side applications with modern languages and frameworks
        </p>
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <div>
            <h4 class="font-medium mb-2">Languages & Frameworks</h4>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-sm">
              <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-blue-50 text-blue-700 dark:bg-blue-900/30 dark:text-blue-300">Java</span>
              <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-red-50 text-red-700 dark:bg-red-900/30 dark:text-red-300">Springboot</span>
              <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-green-50 text-green-700 dark:bg-green-900/30 dark:text-green-300">Microservices</span>
              <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-purple-50 text-purple-700 dark:bg-purple-900/30 dark:text-purple-300">kafka</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="font-medium mb-2">Databases & Tools</h4>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-sm">
              <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-gray-100 text-gray-700 dark:bg-gray-800 dark:text-gray-300">OracleSQL</span>
              <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-gray-100 text-gray-700 dark:bg-gray-800 dark:text-gray-300">Redis</span>
              <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-gray-100 text-gray-700 dark:bg-gray-800 dark:text-gray-300">REST APIs</span>
              <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-gray-100 text-gray-700 dark:bg-gray-800 dark:text-gray-300">Spring Jobs</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="border xq-border rounded-lg p-6 md:p-8 xq-transition hover:shadow-lg">
        <div class="flex items-center mb-4">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-green-500/10 flex items-center justify-center mr-4">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 xq-accent" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 20l4-16m4 4l4 4-4 4M6 16l-4-4 4-4"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-semibold">Frontend Development</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="text-base leading-relaxed mb-4 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
          Creating responsive, accessible user interfaces with modern frameworks and tools
        </p>
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <div>
            <h4 class="font-medium mb-2">Frameworks & Libraries</h4>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-sm">
              <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-green-50 text-green-700 dark:bg-green-900/30 dark:text-green-300">Vue.js</span>
              <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-blue-50 text-blue-700 dark:bg-blue-900/30 dark:text-blue-300">React</span>
              <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-orange-50 text-orange-700 dark:bg-orange-900/30 dark:text-orange-300">Astro</span>
              <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-yellow-50 text-yellow-700 dark:bg-yellow-900/30 dark:text-yellow-300">JavaScript</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="font-medium mb-2">Styling & Tools</h4>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-sm">
              <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-gray-100 text-gray-700 dark:bg-gray-800 dark:text-gray-300">Tailwind CSS</span>
              <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-gray-100 text-gray-700 dark:bg-gray-800 dark:text-gray-300">TypeScript</span>
              <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-gray-100 text-gray-700 dark:bg-gray-800 dark:text-gray-300">Responsive Design</span>
              <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-gray-100 text-gray-700 dark:bg-gray-800 dark:text-gray-300">Performance</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="border xq-border rounded-lg p-6 md:p-8 xq-transition hover:shadow-lg">
        <div class="flex items-center mb-4">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-purple-500/10 flex items-center justify-center mr-4">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 xq-accent" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 11H5m14 0a2 2 0 012 2v6a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-6a2 2 0 012-2m14 0V9a2 2 0 00-2-2M5 11V9a2 2 0 012-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h6a2 2 0 012 2v2M7 7h10"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-semibold">DevOps & Tools</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="text-base leading-relaxed mb-4 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
          Streamlining development workflows with automation and infrastructure tools
        </p>
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <div>
            <h4 class="font-medium mb-2">CI/CD & Deployment</h4>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-sm">
              <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-gray-900 text-white dark:bg-gray-700">GitHub Actions</span>
              <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-blue-50 text-blue-700 dark:bg-blue-900/30 dark:text-blue-300">Docker</span>
              <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-orange-50 text-orange-700 dark:bg-orange-900/30 dark:text-orange-300">Linux</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="font-medium mb-2">Development Tools</h4>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-sm">
              <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-gray-100 text-gray-700 dark:bg-gray-800 dark:text-gray-300">Git</span>
              <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-gray-100 text-gray-700 dark:bg-gray-800 dark:text-gray-300">Monitoring</span>
              <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-gray-100 text-gray-700 dark:bg-gray-800 dark:text-gray-300">Performance</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="border xq-border rounded-lg p-6 md:p-8 xq-transition hover:shadow-lg">
        <div class="flex items-center mb-4">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-yellow-500/10 flex items-center justify-center mr-4">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 xq-accent" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9.663 17h4.673M12 3v1m6.364 1.636l-.707.707M21 12h-1M4 12H3m3.343-5.657l-.707-.707m2.828 9.9a5 5 0 117.072 0l-.548.547A3.374 3.374 0 0014 18.469V19a2 2 0 11-4 0v-.531c0-.895-.356-1.754-.988-2.386l-.548-.547z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-semibold">Best Practices</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="text-base leading-relaxed mb-4 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
          Following industry standards for maintainable, scalable software development
        </p>
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <div>
            <h4 class="font-medium mb-2">Code Quality</h4>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-sm">
              <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-green-50 text-green-700 dark:bg-green-900/30 dark:text-green-300">Test-Driven Development</span>
              <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-blue-50 text-blue-700 dark:bg-blue-900/30 dark:text-blue-300">Code Review</span>
              <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-purple-50 text-purple-700 dark:bg-purple-900/30 dark:text-purple-300">Clean Architecture</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="font-medium mb-2">Development Philosophy</h4>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-sm">
              <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-gray-100 text-gray-700 dark:bg-gray-800 dark:text-gray-300">Documentation</span>
              <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-gray-100 text-gray-700 dark:bg-gray-800 dark:text-gray-300">DX Focus</span>
              <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-gray-100 text-gray-700 dark:bg-gray-800 dark:text-gray-300">Agile</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 p-6 border xq-border rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-50/50 to-green-50/50 dark:from-blue-900/10 dark:to-green-900/10">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-3 xq-accent">Currently Exploring</h3>
      <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
        Always learning and staying current with emerging technologies. Recent focus areas include 
        AI/ML integration, performance optimization techniques, and modern web architecture patterns.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
